      "@id": "kt:multitenancy",
      "@type": "kto:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "Multitenancy",
      "skos:definition": "The architectural principle by which one Salesforce instance, database schema and runtime kernel serve many customer orgs at once, each isolated by an org (tenant) ID and customized purely through metadata.",
