      "skos:prefLabel": "Order of Execution",
      "skos:definition": "The fixed sequence in which Salesforce runs validation, record-triggered flows, Apex triggers, duplicate rules, legacy automation, roll-up recalculation, sharing and commit whenever a record is inserted, updated or upserted.",
